function AboutClick()
  showMessage(gAboutText)
end
gAboutText=[[GTA SA: Cheats Companion App
 * to be used with ".pnach" et Modified "Main.scm"

Incomplete:
 0. The Initialisation File (.ini) should be present in CheatApp.exe directory

 * The only line that MUST be present is "NoFallDMG=0"
 * The other options have not been implemented.

 * NFD for a fresh game should be set to 0
 * dynamic address for NFD will be written to text file when found
 * dynamic address can be kept the same if locading a save state before using load from memcard features.
 * use the address from the file to revert changes to NFD manualy with pnach

App Instructions;-
  1. Toggle Cheats, with Hotkeys

  2. Vehicle ID
     Increase [+] or [GAMEPAD (R2)]
     Decrease [-] or [GAMEPAD (L2)]
     Type Name, - or Model Number using NUMPAD

  3. Teleport 1
     Check negative if needed
     Type value using NUMPAD, assign an axis (x,y,z).
     In-Game -&gt; open teleport cheat menu (Select + L1)
     Select Option 7 "The Four Dragons Casino"
     Optional: Use .pnach to change to a custom label.

  3. Teleport 2
     Open Menu, In-Game Map
     Put Golden Cross in Position then Click App Button
     It will Set Cheat Menu Option 7 to those coordinates.
     It uses Cross positon, NOT the Player Target (red marker)!

Issues;-
  1. Spawn VH not updating.
  * Common emulator behaviour - Save and Load State to update changes.
  ...Or...
  * in Emulator -&gt; enable ".pnach" Cheats and execute these once;-
  * Execute: Hold R1 - (increment VH ID (+1))
  * Execute: R1+R2   - (Enable VH Spawn),
  * Execute: Any buttons x 2 to spawn a VH,
  * Execute: L1+L2 (Disable VH Spawn).

  * You can now use Cheat Menu buttons for that game session.
  And
  * Disable "R1 (+1)" pnach patch, use the apps R2, L2 to +/- VHID.

www.TKBS.uk]]


